:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="dolx-changelog">
		<div class="dolx-changelog-hero">
			<span class="dolx-changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>v0.20.11</span></h1>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="dolx-changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>New feats
		<ul>
			<li>Added a feat for giving birth anally while affected by an Omega pill.
			</li>
			<li>Added two new feats related to complying with requests at the Gentleman’s Club.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Realistic childbirth content
		<ul>
			<li>Added realistic childbirth to Gwylan’s birth scene.
			</li>
			<li>Portal effects can no longer cause sexual encounters during realistic childbirth.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added lube to the hospital pharmacy
		<ul>
			<li>The hospital pharmacy now sells a separate three-use lube tube.
			</li>
			<li>Adult-shop lube bottles now provide five uses.
			</li>
			<li>Lube tubes are stored separately from bottled lube.
			</li>
			<li>Lube tubes cannot be used to refill the brothel vending machine.
			</li>
			<li>Combat now consumes the correct carried lube type and removes the correct container when empty.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>More plums and peaches
		<ul>
			<li>Added a random forest encounter of finding wild plum and peach trees.
			</li>
			<li>Avery’s garden now displays separate <strong>Steal oranges</strong> and <strong>Steal plums</strong> options.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Remy’s spiking scene
		<ul>
			<li>Remy’s pill in the <strong>Livestock Milking Obey</strong> scene now gives the player a hermaphroditic body instead of simply reversing their sex.
			</li>
			<li>Remy now mixes growth formula into the pill, immediately increasing breast size by two stages unless the player is already at the maximum.
			</li>
			<li>The scene now ends with Remy declaring the player “milkable at both ends.”
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Water Dragon content
		<ul>
			<li>Expanded the Water Dragon lore provided by the island elder.
			</li>
			<li>Restored a missing Water Dragon travel link.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated loitering
		<ul>
			<li>The player can now be interrupted while loitering.
			</li>
			<li>When an interruption occurs, the waiting period ends immediately.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Poppy’s schedule
		<ul>
			<li>Poppy now visits Bailey from 7:00 AM on weekends and school holidays.
			</li>
			<li>Each visit lasts a randomized 25–60 minutes.
			</li>
			<li>Bailey’s normal office interactions become available after Poppy’s visit ends.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Increased the randomness of maths-envelope delivery events.
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Rebalancing and Fixes</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Reworked Insanity-trait in combat
		<ul>
			<li>Permanent and temporary Insanity now paralyses the player for the first two turns of combat.
			</li>
			<li>Gaining focus while dissociated, such as by poking yourself or attempting to speak, removes an additional turn from the paralysis.
			</li>
			<li>Willpower now counters Insanity-based combat dissociation:
			<ul>
				<li>At 350 or more willpower, paralysis is reduced to one turn.
				</li>
				<li>At 700 or more willpower, paralysis is prevented entirely.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>Mild dissociation remains for the rest of the encounter after the player surfaces.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Tweaked consensual Insanity lash-outs
		<ul>
			<li>Active permanent or temporary Insanity now makes one 13% lash-out roll per consensual encounter.
			</li>
			<li>Non-consensual encounters retain their original behaviour.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Omega and Breeder heat behaviour
		<ul>
			<li>X-Change heat now treats every pregnancy-capable hole as a valid breeding target.
			</li>
			<li>Previously, combat heat only checked vaginal penetration.
			<ul>
				<li>This could leave Omegas being bred anally unsatisfied.
				</li>
				<li>It could also trigger repeated compulsion messages or redirect their actions toward vaginal penetration.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>Anal breeding now supports the same heat behaviours as vaginal breeding, including:
			<ul>
				<li>Leg-locking.
				</li>
				<li>Condom removal.
				</li>
				<li>Undressing.
				</li>
				<li>Guiding penetration.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>Omegas no longer request that partners avoid anal sex while in heat.
			</li>
			<li>Omega combat heat can now activate for characters without a vagina.
			</li>
			<li>Non-Omega Breeder heat continues to redirect penetration toward the vagina.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated forceful heat
		<ul>
			<li>Forceful heat now recognizes all pregnancy-capable holes, including anal pregnancy for Omegas.
			</li>
			<li>Characters without a vagina are no longer directed toward vaginal actions.
			</li>
			<li>Being bred through either eligible hole now satisfies the heat compulsion.
			</li>
			<li>Chastity belts no longer disable forceful heat completely.
			</li>
			<li>When every eligible hole is locked, the player may:
			<ul>
				<li>Remove concealing clothing.
				</li>
				<li>Struggle against the chastity device.
				</li>
				<li>Gradually damage the device.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>Normal forceful-heat behaviour resumes after the belt breaks.
			</li>
			<li>Added appropriate behaviour for chastity parasites and characters whose arms are restrained.
			</li>
			<li>Updated the forceful-heat setting description to explain its interaction with chastity devices.
			</li>
			<li>Pregnancy from semen deposited outside a chastity belt has not been added, as external semen is not currently a valid conception method.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated the Alpha pill
		<ul>
			<li>When Alpha is combined with Breeder or Omega, Alpha’s dominant urge now takes priority while the player’s penis is usable.
			</li>
			<li>Forceful heat will no longer override the player with receptive actions in this situation.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Resistance and Continue pills
		<ul>
			<li>Resistance and Continue can now be used during any active X-Change session.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Reworked the Gentleman’s Club introduction at the pub
		<ul>
			<li>Rewrote Landry’s explanation to better match their characterization.
			</li>
			<li>The “top-notch material” description can now be received when the player has a good reputation and low allure, reinforcing their good standing instead make Landry behave not like themselves.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Tweaked Avery’s bank gala flow
		<ul>
			<li>Bank gala now totally hidden.
			</li>
			<li>After the gala, Avery confirms that the original guest will attend the next party.
			</li>
			<li>Reduced the gala invitation chance from 33% to 30%.
			</li>
			<li>Added an eight-party cooldown between gala invitations.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Updated Whitney’s special orphanage visit
		<ul>
			<li>Added two hallway interactions after the player rejects Whitney.
			</li>
			<li>Added a park interaction when the player attempts to apologize.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed missing outfit pieces
		<ul>
			<li>Added protection for missing clothing items and missing outfit counterparts.
			</li>
			<li>Clothing pieces that cannot be resolved now contribute zero warmth instead of crashing the wardrobe list.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed costume makeup
		<ul>
			<li>The Custom Makeup colour picker now initializes its temporary colour records directly.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the Statistics overlay
		<ul>
			<li>Corrected displayed health and scaling values.
			</li>
			<li>Capped health bonuses are now calculated using the configured multiplier instead of the number of buffs.
			</li>
			<li>Day, defeat, and level scaling display 0% when disabled.
			</li>
			<li>Level-scaling enable toggles are now respected.
			</li>
			<li>Defeat-level bonuses are now compared against the configured limit.
			</li>
			<li>Displayed encounter scaling now mirrors the logic used to apply encounter scaling.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed bank gala time progression
		<ul>
			<li>Time now passes correctly during the bank gala.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed sudden time jumps during Avery’s party events
		<ul>
			<li>Avery’s party event now waits for the appropriate time instead of dragging the player forward with the clock.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Avery’s consensual sex scene
		<ul>
			<li>This prevents the broken “mysterious stat creature” from appearing.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Avery’s garden text
		<ul>
			<li>Corrected missing sentence breaks and related formatting.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed a missing pronoun after giving birth at Alex’s cottage.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed a missing pronoun in Poppy’s flat dialogue.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Whitney’s special orphanage dialogue
		<ul>
			<li>Whitney now refers to their actual genitals instead of always saying, “My dick’s still out.”
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Whitney’s toilet rule
		<ul>
			<li>Removed the 25% chance that Whitney assigned the player to the toilets they would already naturally use.
			</li>
			<li>Whitney now always assigns the opposite toilets based on the player’s current body.
			</li>
			<li>X-Change body effects are included when determining the assignment.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the HBSC <strong>Deposit maximum</strong> option
		<ul>
			<li>Fractional-penny cash values can no longer round above the player’s actual balance.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the Dye Harder hair-colour mismatch
		<ul>
			<li>Mirror hairstyle previews now use the saved custom Dye Harder filter.
			</li>
			<li>Hairdresser mannequin previews now use the correct filter.
			</li>
			<li>Simple and gradient custom dyes are supported.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed custom-colour preset saving
		<ul>
			<li>Clicking the save icon now opens a text box asking for a preset name.
			</li>
			<li>Blank names are rejected.
			</li>
			<li>Duplicate names are rejected.
			</li>
			<li>The colour is saved and automatically selected in the dropdown.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed X-Change Blue NOW transformation text
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Gray pill use
		</li>
		<li>Fixed NPC pill transformations
		<ul>
			<li>A female NPC given a Blue pill now receives a male body.
			</li>
			<li>A male NPC given a Pink pill now receives a female body.
			</li>
			<li>Restoration continues to return the NPC to their original body.
			</li>
			<li>The traits overlay now reports the NPC’s actual transformed body.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed a missing NPC in the prison pill scene.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed sex-toy addiction checks
		<ul>
			<li>Sex toys no longer count as worn after they have been:
			<ul>
				<li>Removed normally.
				</li>
				<li>Returned to the inventory.
				</li>
				<li>Removed during combat.
				</li>
				<li>Cleared by a body transformation.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Cock Addict and Hole Addict compatibility
		<ul>
			<li>Cock Addict and Hole Addict can no longer be active at the same time.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Hole Addict orgasm blocking
		<ul>
			<li>Hole Addict no longer prevent orgasm while the player has no penis.
			</li>
			<li>This includes bodies created by gender-flipping X-Change pills.
			</li>
			<li>Since the player has no penis to insert, the craving remains dormant until their penis returns.
			</li>
			<li>Trait descriptions now explain this behaviour.
			</li>
			<li>Also fixed the following encounters incorrectly treating the player as unable to orgasm:
			<ul>
				<li>Ear slime.
				</li>
				<li>Moor phallus plant.
				</li>
				<li>Lake ruin wraith.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>These encounters now distinguish between an active trait and a trait merely locked by its counterpart.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed combat anatomy conflicts
		<ul>
			<li>Prevented multiple NPCs from claiming the player’s penis simultaneously.
			</li>
			<li>Stale X-ray frames no longer display duplicated anatomy.
			</li>
			<li>Insertable toys and strokers now reliably force hollow orgasms for addiction and X-Change effects.
			</li>
			<li>Updated the related trait descriptions to match the corrected behaviour.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed cleanliness checks for plugs and dildos
		<ul>
			<li>Fluids sealed inside the player by a plug or sufficiently large dildo no longer prevent entry to wards or babysitting events.
			</li>
			<li>Small dildos still allow fluids to leak and therefore continue to affect cleanliness checks.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed unknown-father skin-colour probability
		<ul>
			<li>The slider now works as expected:
			<ul>
				<li>0% means the unknown father will never have dark skin.
				</li>
				<li>100% means the unknown father will always have dark skin.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>This change only affects new conceptions.
			</li>
			<li>Existing children retain the skin colour stored in their save data.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the pet-shop parasite-birth check
		<ul>
			<li>The pet shop now counts parasite births from either hole.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the shady dealer
		<ul>
			<li>The player can no longer interact with the shady dealer if naked.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the MMA Gym closing time
		<ul>
			<li>Entering the gym at 9:00 PM now reaches the closing-time scene instead of the empty nighttime version.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed a missing tutorial link
		<ul>
			<li>Restored the missing link after selecting the skip or lose-encounter option.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the bedroom poster.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed broken soup-kitchen combat.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed feat boost 2.5
		</li>
		<li>Tidied the cheat menu
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the debug menu
		<ul>
			<li>Corrected errors affecting debug-menu entries, including:
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Rape Me</strong>.
				</li>
				<li><strong>Gang Rape Me w/ Audience</strong>.
				</li>
				<li>Beast encounters.
				</li>
				<li>Pregnancy progress by day or week.
				</li>
				<li>Leighton inspections.
				</li>
				<li>NNPC Parade.
				</li>
				<li>Forest Shop.
				</li>
				<li>Swarm tests.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>Options that only work during combat, such as <strong>Turn beast into...</strong> and <strong>Distract Robin Crowd</strong>, are now hidden when they do not apply.
			</li>
			<li>Favourited debug entries continue working after saving and loading.
			</li>
			<li><strong>Become Alluring</strong> and <strong>Become Unalluring</strong> now correctly change the player’s allure.
			</li>
			<li>A single damaged NPC slot no longer causes the entire combat turn to error.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Added automated debug-menu tests
		<ul>
			<li>The tests automatically click through every debug-menu entry.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Improved YAML compatibility so generated ZIP files work correctly on Linux.
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon images" aria-hidden="true">&#128444;</span> Imagepack Update</h2>
	<ul>
