			<li>Fixed missing hoodie sprites.
			</li>
			<li>Fixed the masculine fur cap, or raccoon cap, mask.
			</li>
			<li>Fixed several missing icons.
			</li>
			<li>Fixed the paper fan and paper parasol.
			<ul>
				<li>Only the plain variants are currently available.
				</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
			<li>Fixed missing right-facing idle and arm-covering mannequin sprites.
			</li>
			<li>Edited dreads so they no longer have gaps around the arms.
			</li>
			<li>Added missing back sprites for dreads and the ruffled hairstyle.
			</li>
